<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<catalogue xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema" id="opr36-bs-catalogue" name="Blessed Sisters" revision="3" battleScribeVersion="2.03" library="false" gameSystemId="b174-c09d-3660-f001" gameSystemRevision="5"><sharedRules><rule id="bs36-r2-00001" name="Devout" hidden="false"><description>When this model shoots/charges enemies over 9&quot;/6&quot; away, unmodified result of 6 to hit deal 1 extra hit (only the original hit counts as a 6 for special rules).</description></rule><rule id="bs36-r2-00002" name="Bravery Buff" hidden="false"><description>Once per activation, before attacking, pick one friendly unit within 12&quot;, which gets +1 to Morale Test rolls once (next time the effect would apply).</description></rule><rule id="bs36-r2-00003" name="Brutal" hidden="false"><description>When this model shoots/charges enemies over 9&quot;/6&quot; away, unmodified result of 6 to hit deal 1 extra hit (only the original hit counts as a 6 for special rules).</description></rule><rule id="bs36-r2-00004" name="Enhanced Brutal" hidden="false"><description>If this model has Brutal, the target always takes hits on unmodified hit results of 6 from Brutal (instead of only when shooting/charging enemies over 9&quot;/6&quot; away).</description></rule><rule id="bs36-r2-00005" name="Enhanced Devout" hidden="false"><description>If this model has Devout, the target always takes hits on unmodified hit results of 6 from Devout (instead of only when shooting/charging enemies over 9&quot;/6&quot; away).</description></rule><rule id="bs36-r2-00006" name="Fortified" hidden="false"><description>When units where most models have this rule take hits, those hits count as having AP(-1), to a min. of AP(0).</description></rule><rule id="bs36-r2-00007" name="Guarded" hidden="false"><description>If most models in this unit have this rule, they get +1 to Defense rolls when shot/charged from over 9&quot;/6&quot; away.</description></rule><rule id="bs36-r2-00008" name="Guarded Buff" hidden="false"><description>Once per activation, before attacking, pick one friendly unit within 12&quot;, which gets Guarded once (next time the effect would apply).</description></rule><rule id="bs36-r2-00009" name="Increased Shooting Range" hidden="false"><description>This model gets +6&quot; range on its weapons when shooting.</description></rule><rule id="bs36-r2-0000a" name="Piercing Charge" hidden="false"><description>This model gets AP(+1) on its weapons when charging.</description></rule><rule id="bs36-r2-0000b" name="Piercing Marksman" hidden="false"><description>When shooting at enemies over 9&quot; away, this model's weapons get AP(+1).</description></rule><rule id="bs36-r2-0000c" name="Precision Fighter Buff" hidden="false"><description>Once per activation, before attacking, pick one friendly unit within 12&quot;, which gets +1 to hit rolls in melee once (next time the effect would apply).</description></rule><rule id="bs36-r2-0000d" name="Precision Shooter Buff" hidden="false"><description>Once per activation, before attacking, pick one friendly unit within 12&quot;, which gets +1 to hit rolls when shooting once (next time the effect would apply).</description></rule><rule id="bs36-r2-0000e" name="Precision Target" hidden="false"><description>Once per game, during this model's activation, before attacking, pick X enemy units within 18&quot; and in line of sight of it, and place one token on them. Friendly units get +1 to hit rolls when attacking them.</description></rule><rule id="bs36-r2-0000f" name="Purge" hidden="false"><description>When attacking units that are Shaken or Fatigued, this weapon gets AP(+2).</description></rule><rule id="bs36-r2-0000g" name="Spell Conduit" hidden="false"><description>Casters within 12&quot; that are from other friendly units may cast spells as if they were in this model's position, and get +1 to casting rolls when doing so. Friendly casters may only use this rule if this unit isn't Shaken.</description></rule><rule id="bs36-r2-0000h" name="Spell Drain" hidden="false"><description>Once per activation, before attacking, pick one enemy model within 18&quot; in line of sight, which must take a Morale Test. If failed, it loses 2 spell tokens.</description></rule><rule id="bs36-r2-0000i" name="Unique Hero" hidden="false"><description>Counts as having Hero, and this model may only be taken once per army.</description></rule><rule id="bs36-r2-0000j" name="Bravery Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get +1 to Morale Test rolls.</description></rule><rule id="bs36-r2-0000k" name="Enhanced Devout Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Enhanced Devout.</description></rule><rule id="bs36-r2-0000l" name="Fast Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit moves +2&quot; when using Advance actions and +4&quot; when using Rush/Charge actions.</description></rule><rule id="bs36-r2-0000m" name="Fortified Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Fortified.</description></rule><rule id="bs36-r2-0000n" name="Increased Shooting Range Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get +6&quot; range on its weapons when shooting.</description></rule><rule id="bs36-r2-0000o" name="Piercing Marksman Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Piercing Marksman.</description></rule><rule id="bs36-r2-0000p" name="Regeneration Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Regeneration.</description></rule><rule id="bs36-r2-0000q" name="Shred in Melee Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Shred on its weapons in melee.</description></rule><rule id="bs36-r2-0000r" name="Shred in Melee" hidden="false"><description>This model gets Shred on its weapons in melee.</description></rule><rule id="bs36-r2-0000s" name="Burn the Heretic (1)" hidden="false"><description>Pick one enemy unit within 18&quot; in line of sight, which loses 2 spell tokens. Note that the target may not spend those spell tokens to prevent this effect.</description></rule><rule id="bs36-r2-0000t" name="Eternal Flame (1)" hidden="false"><description>Pick one enemy unit within 12&quot; in line of sight, which takes 3 hits with Purge.</description></rule><rule id="bs36-r2-0000u" name="Holy Rage (2)" hidden="false"><description>Pick up to two friendly units within 12&quot;, which get Piercing Marksman once (next time the effect would apply).</description></rule><rule id="bs36-r2-0000v" name="Searing Admonition (2)" hidden="false"><description>Pick one enemy unit within 18&quot; in line of sight, which takes 2 hits with Blast(3).</description></rule><rule id="bs36-r2-0000w" name="Litanies of War (3)" hidden="false"><description>Pick up to three friendly units within 18&quot;, which get Enhanced Devout once (next time the effect would apply).</description></rule><rule id="bs36-r2-0000x" name="Righteous Wrath (3)" hidden="false"><description>Pick one enemy model within 24&quot; in line of sight, which takes 3 hits with AP(4). This effect is resolved as if the target was a unit of [1].</description></rule><rule id="bs36-r2-0000y" name="Anti-Cover" hidden="false"><description>When attacking with this weapon, ignore the target's cover protection.</description></rule><rule id="bs36-r2-0000z" name="Armor(2)" hidden="false"><description>While the item granting this rule is equipped, this model uses Defense 2+.</description></rule><rule id="bs36-r2-00010" name="Armor(3)" hidden="false"><description>While the item granting this rule is equipped, this model uses Defense 3+.</description></rule></sharedRules><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="opr-spellcat-bs-entry" name="Spell Catalogue" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="bs36-r2-003ay" name="Spell Catalogue" targetId="opr-spell-catalogue-category" primary="true" hidden="false"/></categoryLinks><infoLinks><infoLink id="bs36-r2-003az" name="Burn the Heretic (1)" targetId="bs36-r2-0000s" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="bs36-r2-003b0" name="Eternal Flame (1)" targetId="bs36-r2-0000t" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="bs36-r2-003b1" name="Holy Rage (2)" targetId="bs36-r2-0000u" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="bs36-r2-003b2" name="Searing Admonition (2)" targetId="bs36-r2-0000v" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="bs36-r2-003b3" name="Litanies of War (3)" targetId="bs36-r2-0000w" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="bs36-r2-003b4" name="Righteous Wrath (3)" targetId="bs36-r2-0000x" type="rule" hidden="false"/></infoLinks><constraints><constraint id="bs36-r2-003b5" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true"/><constraint id="bs36-r2-003b6" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true"/></constraints></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="bs36-r2-00039" name="Exo-Suit High Sister" type="unit" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="bs36-r2-00034" name="Heroes" targetId="b174-c09d-3660-f041" primary="true" hidden="false"/></categoryLinks><profiles><profile id="bs36-r2-00035" name="Exo-Suit High Sister" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f010" typeName="Unit" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic name="Quality" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f011">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Defense" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f012">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f013">Devout, Fear(2), Hero, Tough(9)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><infoLinks><infoLink id="bs36-r2-00036" name="Devout" targetId="bs36-r2-00001" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="bs36-r2-00037" name="Fear(2)" targetId="opr-core-fear" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="bs36-r2-00038" name="Hero" targetId="opr-core-hero" type="rule" hidden="false"/></infoLinks><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="bs36-r2-00033" name="Model 1" type="model" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true">